{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226620","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226620","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"narration:2:1222662001:0":{"text":"数小时后，瓦因匆匆归来，向卢卡汇报——","source_cn":"数小时后，瓦因匆匆归来，向卢卡汇报——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEAC003D873D7E17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222662002:0":{"text":"跟踪纳莉安的这一路有了大收获！各位，我长话短说。","source_cn":"跟踪纳莉安的这一路有了大收获！各位，我长话短说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2833833EA4D52451","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222662003:0":{"text":"我们放走她后，她没有回家，又去到处瞎转悠，接触那些贩子。","source_cn":"我们放走她后，她没有回家，又去到处瞎转悠，接触那些贩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66873FD744993494","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222662004:0":{"text":"哎？所以她真的是坏人啊！","source_cn":"哎？所以她真的是坏人啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49EE9213860625ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222662005:0":{"text":"别心急啊，听我说完。","source_cn":"别心急啊，听我说完。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A69554DE4BD7DAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222662006:0":{"text":"一开始没人卖她船，但等红锚传了消息，我看灰舌亲自去找她，卖给她一条船！","source_cn":"一开始没人卖她船，但等红锚传了消息，我看灰舌亲自去找她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0A3665A93749814","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222662007:0":{"text":"等交易定下来，她故意在城里兜了几圈，像是要甩掉跟踪者——但她肯定甩不掉我！","source_cn":"等交易定下来，她故意在城里兜了几圈，像是要甩掉跟踪者—...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01973398CE9AB33C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222662008:1":{"text":"接着，她去了小水村！","source_cn":"接着，她去了小水村！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E103770EE22DE4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222662009:0":{"text":"小水村！那是辛巴达的家，她去那里干什么？","source_cn":"小水村！那是辛巴达的家，她去那里干什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BEBC9D130E5941F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222662010:0":{"text":"她进了一间没人住的破屋子，我趴在窗口，看见那屋子里竟然藏着一个亡灵！","source_cn":"她进了一间没人住的破屋子，我趴在窗口，看见那屋子里竟然...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FFC04059E1AE3DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222662011:0":{"text":"那亡灵跟通缉令上长得一模一样！","source_cn":"那亡灵跟通缉令上长得一模一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21DA